    "After installation, approve the fixed CodeWake command in `/hooks`, then run one real turn in both Codex Desktop and Codex CLI. Claude Code uses its normal settings trust flow. Configuration alone is not shown as runtime verification.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After installation, approve the fixed CodeWake command in `/hooks`, then run one real turn in both Codex Desktop and Codex CLI. Claude Code uses its normal settings trust flow. Configuration alone is not shown as runtime verification."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装后，请在 `/hooks` 中批准固定的 CodeWake · 醒码 命令，然后分别在 Codex Desktop 和 Codex CLI 中实际运行一轮。Claude Code 使用其常规设置授权流程。仅完成配置不会显示为已通过运行验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the final successful AI turn, it confirms completion for five seconds and sleeps a closed Mac when no manual hold remains.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
