    "Start a Codex or Claude Code turn, leave the Mac plugged in and ventilated, then close the lid. CodeWake keeps it awake while work is active. A successful final Stop gets a cancelable five-second confirmation before the closed Mac sleeps; waiting for input keeps its five-minute grace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a Codex or Claude Code turn, leave the Mac plugged in and ventilated, then close the lid. CodeWake keeps it awake while work is active. A successful final Stop gets a cancelable five-second confirmation before the closed Mac sleeps; waiting for input keeps its five-minute grace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动一轮 Codex 或 Claude Code 任务，让 Mac 保持接通电源和良好通风，然后合上上盖。工作进行时，CodeWake · 醒码 会保持唤醒。最后一次 Stop 成功后，会进行可取消的五秒确认，再让合盖的 Mac 睡眠；等待输入时仍保留五分钟宽限期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
